---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import PageHero from '@/components/pages/PageHero.astro'
import PageFoot from '@/components/pages/PageFoot.astro'
import ProjectCover from '@/components/pages/ProjectCover.astro'
import ProjectNav from '@/components/pages/ProjectNav.astro'
import ProjectDetailMotion from '@/components/pages/ProjectDetailMotion.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Class Space · 陈润森"
  description="Class Space：班级记忆现场——相册、同学档案与只属于我们这一班的片段。"
>
  <PageHero
    kicker="project · 2025"
    title="Class Space"
    summary="班级记忆现场：相册、同学档案与只属于我们这一班的片段。"
  />

  <main class="p-page p-detail">
    <nav class="p-crumbs" data-reveal aria-label="所在位置">
      <a href="/">首页</a>
      <span class="p-crumbs__sep">/</span>
      <a href="/projects">项目</a>
      <span class="p-crumbs__sep">/</span>
      <span aria-current="page">Class Space</span>
    </nav>
    <div class="p-detail-meta" data-flow data-intersect>
      <span class="p-detail-meta__badge">active</span>
      <span>2025 · 持续记录</span>
      <span>project 06 / 08</span>
    </div>
    <ProjectCover slug="class-space" />
    <div class="p-prose" data-intersect>
      <p>这个站最柔软的一角，收藏我们这一班的现场。</p>
      <h2>有什么</h2>
      <p>
        照片与视频组成的<a href="/class/gallery">班级画廊</a
        >、同学与老师的档案卡、以及一面可以写字的班级留言墙——都收在<a
          href="/class">班级空间</a
        >里。
      </p>
      <h2>边界</h2>
      <p>
        画廊公开可读；档案与留言需要<a href="/account">登录</a
        >——它属于班上的人。到访计数会记住每一次回来看看。
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="p-chips" data-flow data-intersect>
      <span class="p-card__tag">Astro</span>
      <span class="p-card__tag">TypeScript</span>
      <span class="p-card__tag">Fastify</span>
    </div>
    <div class="p-card__actions" data-flow data-intersect>
      <a class="p-card__link" href="/class" data-seal> 进入班级空间 </a>
      <a class="p-card__link" href="/class/gallery" data-seal> 班级画廊 </a>
      <a class="p-card__link" href="/account" data-seal> 登录账号 </a>
    </div>
    <ProjectNav slug="class-space" />

    <ProjectDetailMotion />
  </main>

  <PageFoot current="/projects" />
</BaseLayout>
